`,s.jsxs(t.ul,{children:[`
`,s.jsxs(t.li,{children:[s.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Crash Fault Tolerance (CFT)"})," leverages node-level trust as a performance optimization. It gives you high throughput and low latency because you assume your machines won't deceive you."]}),`
`,s.jsxs(t.li,{children:[s.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Byzantine Fault Tolerance (BFT)"})," trades away that performance optimization. You pay a steep tax in network traffic, cryptographic calculations, and latency, and in exchange, you get a system that holds its ground even when the world around it goes completely chaotic."]}),`
`]}),`
