`})}),`
`,s.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The document doesn't have to be globally similar to the query. It just needs to contain enough ",s.jsx(t.strong,{children:"local evidence"})," to satisfy the query's distinct parts."]}),`
`,s.jsx(t.p,{children:"We've preserved local context, but in doing so, we've broken the simple dot product. How do you score two sets of vectors against each other?"}),`
`,s.jsx(t.hr,{}),`
